{"PageNumber":443,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَءَايَةٞ لَّهُمۡ أَنَّا حَمَلۡنَا ذُرِّيَّتَهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡفُلۡكِ ٱلۡمَشۡحُونِ","TajweedText":"وَءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةٌ ل</tajweed>َّهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا حَمَلْنَا ذُرِّيَّتَهُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفُلْكِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَشْح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٤١</span>","End":"٤١","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَخَلَقۡنَا لَهُم مِّن مِّثۡلِهِۦ مَا يَرۡكَبُونَ","TajweedText":"وَخَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَا لَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>ِّثْلِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> مَا يَرْكَب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِن نَّشَأۡ نُغۡرِقۡهُمۡ فَلَا صَرِيخَ لَهُمۡ وَلَا هُمۡ يُنقَذُونَ","TajweedText":"وَإ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن ن</tajweed>َّشَأْ نُغْرِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>هُمْ فَلَا صَرِيخَ لَهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>َذ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَّا رَحۡمَةٗ مِّنَّا وَمَتَٰعًا إِلَىٰ حِينٖ","TajweedText":"إِلَّا رَحْمَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا وَمَتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>عًا إِلَىٰ ح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱتَّقُواْ مَا بَيۡنَ أَيۡدِيكُمۡ وَمَا خَلۡفَكُمۡ لَعَلَّكُمۡ تُرۡحَمُونَ","TajweedText":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيكُمْ وَمَا خَلْفَكُمْ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا تَأۡتِيهِم مِّنۡ ءَايَةٖ مِّنۡ ءَايَٰتِ رَبِّهِمۡ إِلَّا كَانُواْ عَنۡهَا مُعۡرِضِينَ","TajweedText":"وَمَا تَأْتِيه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ِم م</tajweed>ِّنْ ءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٍ م</tajweed>ِّنْ ءَايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ رَبِّهِمْ إِلَّا كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَنْهَا مُعْرِض<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٦</span>","End":"٤٦","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":47,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمۡ أَنفِقُواْ مِمَّا رَزَقَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ لِلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓاْ أَنُطۡعِمُ مَن لَّوۡ يَشَآءُ ٱللَّهُ أَطۡعَمَهُۥٓ إِنۡ أَنتُمۡ إِلَّا فِي ضَلَٰلٖ مُّبِينٖ","TajweedText":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>ِقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا رَزَقَكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ قَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لِلَّذِينَ ءَامَن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَنُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed>عِمُ م<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>َن ل</tajweed>َّوْ يَش<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed>عَمَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِنْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ إِلَّا فِى ضَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>لٍ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٤٧</span>","End":"٤٧","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":48,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَٰذَا ٱلۡوَعۡدُ إِن كُنتُمۡ صَٰدِقِينَ","TajweedText":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْوَعْدُ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٨</span>","End":"٤٨","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":49,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَّا صَيۡحَةٗ وَٰحِدَةٗ تَأۡخُذُهُمۡ وَهُمۡ يَخِصِّمُونَ","TajweedText":"مَا يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرُونَ إِلَّا صَيْحَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>حِدَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةً ت</tajweed>َأْخُذُهُمْ وَهُمْ يَخِصِّم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٩</span>","End":"٤٩","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":50,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَا يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ تَوۡصِيَةٗ وَلَآ إِلَىٰٓ أَهۡلِهِمۡ يَرۡجِعُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ تَوْصِيَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed>َل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَهْلِهِمْ يَرْجِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٠</span>","End":"٥٠","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":383,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":51,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنُفِخَ فِي ٱلصُّورِ فَإِذَا هُم مِّنَ ٱلۡأَجۡدَاثِ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِمۡ يَنسِلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَنُفِخَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صُّورِ فَإِذَا ه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>دَاثِ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِمْ يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نس</tajweed>ِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥١</span>","End":"٥١","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":384,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":52,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ يَٰوَيۡلَنَا مَنۢ بَعَثَنَا مِن مَّرۡقَدِنَاۜۗ هَٰذَا مَا وَعَدَ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ وَصَدَقَ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>وَيْلَنَا م<tajweed class=iqlab>َنۢ ب</tajweed>َعَثَنَا م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>َّرْقَدِنَاۜ‌ۗ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا مَا وَعَدَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نُ وَصَدَقَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُرْسَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٢</span>","End":"٥٢","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":384,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":53,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِن كَانَتۡ إِلَّا صَيۡحَةٗ وَٰحِدَةٗ فَإِذَا هُمۡ جَمِيعٞ لَّدَيۡنَا مُحۡضَرُونَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َانَتْ إِلَّا صَيْحَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>حِدَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةً ف</tajweed>َإِذَا هُمْ جَمِي<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>عٌ ل</tajweed>َّدَيْنَا مُحْضَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٣</span>","End":"٥٣","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":384,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":54,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَٱلۡيَوۡمَ لَا تُظۡلَمُ نَفۡسٞ شَيۡـٔٗا وَلَا تُجۡزَوۡنَ إِلَّا مَا كُنتُمۡ تَعۡمَلُونَ","TajweedText":"فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْيَوْمَ لَا تُظْلَمُ نَفْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>سٌ ش</tajweed>َيْـ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ـًٔا و</tajweed>َلَا تُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>زَوْنَ إِلَّا مَا كُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَعْمَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٤</span>","End":"٥٤","PageNumber":443,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":384,"MaqraNumber":177,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false}]}